From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Market Canopy <office@marketcanopy.invalid>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ignore scheme action and command links; no Enterprise add-on
 license

mc-office://action|... (plugin store installs, panel selection) and
mc-office://command/... links are dropped on every OS (P02 contract
section 3.2), so a web page cannot install a plugin or run an app
command. The Enterprise add-on is built out (build_tools defaults
disable_addon_mode; macOS fastlane no longer defines USE_ADDON_MODE),
and About no longer shows its commercial license.

The start page is also never told that the bundled AI agent is
integrated (upstream sends that whenever OO_BRANDING is defined, which
Office's build defines), so it draws no AI agent panel and About lists
no "ONLYOFFICE AI Tools"; Office's AI is the one inside documents.
---
 macos/ONLYOFFICE/AppDelegate.mm               | 37 ++++---------------
 .../src/cascapplicationmanagerwrapper.cpp     | 20 ++--------
 win-linux/src/windows/cmainwindow.cpp         | 13 ++-----
 3 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 55 deletions(-)

